  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "dd5b5af7eca047a0880a00061140c499",
      "text": "A leader's personality and behavior can either foster or hinder a culture of discipline",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 73
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "c285dace698f4d8baeb855829fc43550",
      "text": "Discipline without understanding of the three circles can lead to short-term gains but long-term decline",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 73
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "0aa446d8d1f34a2781f1d46292138cb4",
      "text": "A leader's focus and priorities can impact the organization's ability to maintain discipline",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 73
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "2f1270bbd2b94545871009e3cb4ba1f3",
      "text": "Stay within your three circles to achieve success",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "67213c88d89c4be6babedbc2f76f9bef",
      "text": "Discipline is essential for translating a simple concept into disciplined action",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "b27912453e4443e2af2b75725f6edb06",
      "text": "Opportunity selection is more important than opportunity creation",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "47a31d4fc469473bb2cddf31cce84a42",
      "text": "Transparency in company operations and decision-making",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "af2a5ff752ac4f388cb758f964f328f6",
      "text": "Equal treatment of all employees, regardless of position",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "068f79be9dd747e9bb33fc3eefd37bc1",
      "text": "Leadership by example and commitment to the company's values",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "e7a08ef3f71442e0a8eda32b47a901eb",
      "text": "Eliminate non-essential activities and resources",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "69140ba96e7143189d3954cebd112d93",
      "text": "Invest fully in the right activities and resources",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "41bbe898c90c46c0b6bd5da56b096e3c",
      "text": "Focus on a single or few key areas of focus",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "837066659e9d4e7bb0b329bbeda3c5c1",
      "text": "Get rid of everything else",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "fb59761b1a0c483da09ed8d407bb998e",
      "text": "Lack of respect for authority can lead to martyrdom",
      "source": {
        "book": "Letters from a Stoic 1",
        "chapter": 259
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "a1d954d389be4cb7a0ba5b17b9d8afc1",
      "text": "One should not prioritize material wealth",
      "source": {
        "book": "Letters from a Stoic 1",
        "chapter": 259
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "3c118d51f305440190034d4cba59121b",
      "text": "{'name': 'Prioritize discipline', 'description': 'Leaders must prioritize discipline in their decision-making process.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 116
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "fb9aab3557ef49e297d80ed06e691d71",
      "text": "{'name': 'Avoid indecision', 'description': 'Leaders must avoid indecision and make clear, decisive decisions.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 116
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "216188baa93046a2bdefd4679223d431",
      "text": "{'name': 'Stay focused', 'description': 'Leaders must stay focused on their goals and avoid distractions.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 116
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "b048b784f6414f7bbfc288b6e418d1f1",
      "text": "{'name': 'Get up at the first alarm', 'description': 'When the alarm goes off, get out of bed immediately to start the day on a positive note'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 120
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "2832ba3fba4246379e0d056e56b8bc7d",
      "text": "{'name': 'Make time for tasks and projects', 'description': 'Schedule time for tasks and projects that are not included in the regular schedule'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 120
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "1b5460e043c14168b143d3209b7b9eea",
      "text": "{'name': 'Prioritize tasks and projects', 'description': 'Prioritize tasks and projects based on importance and urgency to achieve goals and objectives'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 120
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "9627feb52ce64657a166b369012b0da2",
      "text": "{'name': 'Standardize procedures', 'description': 'Standardizing procedures and processes enables teams to operate more efficiently and effectively.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 121
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "46e60261be4d488699ba20819a52ac71",
      "text": "{'name': 'Discipline enables adaptability', 'description': 'Discipline allows teams to adapt and respond to changing situations with ease.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 121
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "c3329722fa494818bb13b2fd69e2de04",
      "text": "{'name': 'Improvise within framework', 'description': 'Teams can improvise and make changes to plans within the framework of established procedures.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 121
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "35ac20d982504be5909106c8131df577",
      "text": "{'id': '1', 'description': 'Leaders must be able to adapt to changing situations.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 147
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "9bf2bef773c54befa532fb2c44f84541",
      "text": "{'id': '2', 'description': 'Discipline must be maintained at all levels of the chain of command.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 147
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "59386ee10d2e448e8dbdb06d7fffefa4",
      "text": "{'id': '3', 'description': 'Decisions must be made quickly and effectively in uncertain situations.'}",
      "source": {
        "book": "extreme_ownership__how_us_navy_seals_lead_and_win",
        "chapter": 147
      },
      "weight": 1.0
